{{For|the Crazy Witch on public islands|Crazy Witch}}
The '''Crazy Witch''' is a mob that spawns during [[Spooky Festival]]s at night. 

== Spawning ==
'''Crazy Witches''' can spawn on the {{Zone|Private Island}} in dark areas at night during a [[Spooky Festival]].

